        + UI.notice(classifier ? 'Registers in <b>Classifiers</b> as a classifier engine served by the classifier worker, and in the Model catalog as a non-routable entry for audit.' : it.caps.includes('transcribe') ? 'Stores the weights for the <b>media workers</b>. No Ollama tag is registered.' : 'Registers in the <b>Model catalog</b> as a draft tag. Evaluation, approval and placement follow the usual lifecycle.', 'info')
        + '<div class="formgrid" style="--cols:3">'
